<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded United Dominion Realty Trust Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Said move reflects improving fundamentals in many of the Southeast and Southwest markets in which the company operates.</p>
<p>-- Said shares have been &quot;grossly oversold.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 to 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
